[17.751424, "o", "？\"\r\n- \"مرحبا، كيف حالك؟\"\r\n- \"Hello, how are you?\"\r\n\r\nExpected output format in detection_results.json:\r\n```json\r\n[\r\n  {\r\n    \"text\": \"input text\",\r\n    \"predicted_class_id\": 0,\r\n    \"confidence\": 0.95\r\n  }\r\n]\r\n```'; tmux wait -S done\r\n\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
